<title>UK: SBC sets &quot;PERLES' on ATX equity index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets &quot;PERLES' on ATX equity index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 500,000 Performance Linked To Equity Securities (PERLES) on the Austrian Traded Index (ATX), lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One PERLE refers to one underlying.</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1051.50 ATS	     GEARING	=</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.NOV.99		 PAYDATE	29.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		SPOT REF     1086 ATS</p>
<p> REDEMPTION	100 PCT OF SPOT PRICE ON EXPIRATION DATE</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
